  "instructions": [
    "in a small bowl, whisk together red wine vinegar, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, oregano, parsley, salt, and pepper.",
    "place the lamb shoulder in a large ziplock bag and pour the marinade over the lamb.",
    "seal the bag and refrigerate for at least 4 hours or overnight.",
    "preheat the robata grill to 220°C.",
    "remove the lamb from the marinade and sear for 5 minutes per side.",
    "transfer the lamb to a serving platter and let rest for 10 minutes.",
    "meanwhile, crumble the kefalograviera cheese into a serving bowl.",
    "add a sprinkle of salt and pepper to the cheese and serve alongside the lamb.",
    "slice the lamb into thin strips and serve with the cheese.",
    "garnish with additional oregano and parsley, if desired."
  ],
